      "text_preview": "\n7.The Government vide G.O.No.10, personnel and Administrative Reforms (Per.S) Department dated, 07.01.1994 have issued guidelines regarding transfer policy."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39a997b7919d4008aa49be2371e92e79_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the said policy, the transfer shall be made on completion of three years of service in the same station."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e0a3d50213d14ae8b0a1ae38d00dcb2b_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "When such is the case, https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.(MD)No.16941 to 16948 of 2024 if any Officers is disturbed within the said tenure, there should be some scheme or method for making such transfers."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39e88aeac1634591abbdece9161f5e7f_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n8.No doubt, the administrative contingency should rise up first."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "853075109c164c40889bff05a74b2817_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There should not be any vacancies in the post of Food Safety Officers."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "01eac78ca4fe49c29bdd847e6b292184_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, there should be some scheme or method to be adopted for effecting such transfers for rationalizing the services of the Officers."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6a827a5519b6427fbb1b336a64a189c7_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This is in view of the reason that some of the Food Safety Officers would have given request for transfer to certain districts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "32e96cd603fc47d09254496e04a8bd99_25",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, it would be appropriate on the part of the respondent to examine such situations and frame some guidelines and modalities before randomly selecting the Officers and posting them across the State."
    },
    {
